{"ID":"20240118151207-0w852ji","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151207-0w852ji","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151207-0w852ji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151207-0zwl5l8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240131092059-0mvw1p8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122115550-dfj68lv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:213,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:213\u0026#125;","title":"145雌黄","type":"doc","updated":"20240131092120"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151207-0zwl5l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151207-0zwl5l8","updated":"20240122115544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛平，主恶创头秃痂疥，杀毒虫虱，身痒邪气，诸毒炼之，久服轻身，增年不老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115547-zevltz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115547-zevltz0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产地同雄黄。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115548-yhvuzgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115548-yhvuzgo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛性平有毒主恶疮杀虫虱，身痒，邪气诸毒，治身面白驳，散皮死肌，血气虫积心腹痛，为外科要药，与雄黄功相仿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115545-ydh7d7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115545-ydh7d7n"}},{"ID":"20240122115549-s7j79s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115549-s7j79s6"}},{"ID":"20240122115550-dfj68lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115550-dfj68lv","updated":"20240131092120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第145味叫雌黄。雄黄跟雌黄呢，产地跟雄黄是一样的，那一般我们用雄黄，我们很少用到雌黄，功能跟雄黄差不多，但雌黄呢，不能吃的，都是外用的。雌黄有毒，都是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"外用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的。一般我用雄黄最多，外用杀毒杀虫，这个都可以使用，和头部长那个疮啊，都可以用，那刚刚讲的硫磺，西洋人呢西医拿硫磺来做成硫磺膏，你看那烫伤用硫磺膏来敷烫伤，实际上中医用硫磺粉敷烫伤就可以，因为它产自火山口，它能够抑制它，西洋人用它做成膏。所有的外科急诊室里面急救的烫伤全部是用硫磺，他们只用在这一个地方，下面，我们下一堂课我们再继续。"}]},{"ID":"20240131092059-0mvw1p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131092059-0mvw1p8"}}]}